```
If `self.call` is `None`, `_unwrapped_call` is `None`.
`iscoroutinefunction(None)` is `False`.
`inspect.isclass(None)` is `False`.
`getattr(None, "__call__", None)` is `None`.
`iscoroutinefunction(None)` is `False`.
So it returns `False`. This is correct.

